  "title": "Flashcard deck moderation: report/block-author endpoints and admin reports queue",
  "start_head": "c6c74e11b5780f13874f8d4a326eab0358cb29ab",
  "preexisting_changes": {},
  "spec": {
    "problem": "",
    "acceptance": [
      {
        "id": "AC1",
        "text": "POST /api/flashcards/decks/{deckId}/report accepts reason spam|abuse|sexual|other from an authenticated learner and returns 401/400/404 for unauthenticated, invalid deckId/reason, unknown deck"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC2",
        "text": "POST /api/flashcards/decks/{deckId}/block-author blocks the deck author for the learner; own and private decks are rejected"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC3",
        "text": "GET /api/admin/flashcards/reports lists reports and POST /api/admin/flashcards/reports/{id}/review dismisses or removes the deck, enforcing admin permission"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC4",
        "text": "Admin UI page flashcards/reports renders the reports queue with en/ja/vi messages and nav entry"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC5",
        "text": "docs/openapi.json and docs/api-route-inventory.json are regenerated so route-contract tests pass with 647 operations"
      }
    ],
    "expected_behavior": "",
    "observed_behavior": "",
    "rollback_plan": "Revert the commit(s): routes, handlers, store methods, admin page and schema.prisma models are additive. ops.deck_report / ops.deck_author_block (migration 20261110160000_deck_moderation) can stay unused. Behavior changes to existing endpoints: ListDecks and GetDeck (deck detail) hide public decks of authors the learner blocked; reverting restores them."
  },
